Welcome to this week's Top 7, where the DEV editorial team handpicks their favorite posts from the previous week. Congrats to all the authors that made it onto the list 👏 Facing the Shai-Hulud Worm: Where the Hell is Easystreet? Sebastian Schürmann ・ Sep 19 #npm #security #github #shaihulud
@sebs walks us through the recent Shai-Hulud supply chain attack on the NPM ecosystem, analyzing each stage of the sophisticated malware campaign. Meow Mountain - postmortem of a 13KB game João L. ・ Sep 16 #js13kgames #gamedev #typescript #javascript
@lopis shares a detailed postmortem of creating Meow Mountain, a grid-based adventure game. He explores the low-tech techniques used for sprite encoding, sound generation, AI pathfinding, and m…
